---
title: Support ticket lifecycle
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> New
    New --> Triage : triage
    state Triage <<choice>>
    Triage --> Open : valid
    Triage --> Rejected : spam / duplicate
    Open --> Open : add note
    Open --> Waiting : ask customer
    Waiting --> Open : customer replies
    state Waiting {
        [*] --> Reminded
        Reminded --> Reminded : nudge
    }
    Open --> Resolved : send fix
    Resolved --> Open : reopen
    Resolved --> [*] : after 7 days
    Rejected --> [*]
    note right of Open : SLA clock runs here
